The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on January 2nd, 2024, announced on [https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/250900/view/3884982211414214319 Steam].

== Documented Changes ==
* Mom's bed now revives all players
* Online Matches Hard Mode online

=== Fixes ===
* Pedestal item functionality
* {{i|Book of Virtues}} + {{i|Mr. ME!}} wisps killing themselves on cooldown doors
* Easter egg menu
* Player off-screen indicators would sometimes display the wrong character
* Desync if a player paused while a fullscreen overlay (ex. rainbow poop) was going
* Aimed attacks (ex. {{i|Marked}}, {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}, etc.) could slightly move the camera of other players
* Players revived after special bosses (ex. {{e|Mother}})
* {{c|Lilith}} ghost baby from shooting
* Wisps staying around after player dies
* Lockup in text chat under specific conditions

